-- classification_keys folds into production_process_keys (and, for the rum raw
-- materials, ingredient_keys); decided 2026-10-27. The label facets were a
-- second home for "how it was made": non-chill-filtered sat in both columns,
-- age-statement flags repeat age_statement_years, sweetness claims repeat the
-- tasting profile's sweetness. The kept terms are now process or maturation
-- terms of the dictionary; this migration (1) upserts the regenerated
-- catalog_terms seed so those terms exist and are active, (2) moves every
-- item's keys by the table below, (3) rebuilds the key-validation trigger
-- without the column, (4) drops the column and the classification term rows,
-- rewrites the second validation layer (constraint triggers) without it, and
-- (5) rewrites the sensory question context without 'facets'.

